le IX Sexual Misconduct Policy Title IX: Pregnancy and Parenting Title IX Reporting Title IX Resources Title IX Training Our Campuses Online Visit AU Facilities Rentals Media Brand Standards Social Media Sites The Ember News & Events Find AU People Arts@Averett Averett Arts Schedule Academics Majors and Programs Undergraduate Undergraduate – Averett Online Graduate Graduate – Averett Online Honor Societies Academic Program List Community Programs Student Success Center Schedule an Appointment Disability Services Tutorial and Writing Center Early Alert System National Bonner Leaders Averett Online General Education Online Programs Catalogs Institutional Research CAEP Accreditation Assessment at Averett University Academic Program Assessment University Assessment Committees Assessment Resources Contact Us Data Institutional Data Data Request Form Quick Facts Institutional Effectiveness & Assessment: Substantive Change Substantive Change Policy Professional Licensure Disclosure Strategic Planning Student Achievement at Averett University Honors Program Registrar’s Office Exam Schedule Academic Calendars Exam Schedule Senior Deadlines & Info Registrar Forms Catalogs Request a Transcript Military and Veteran Services List of Benefits Apply for Benefits Resources Approved Programs Isakson and Roe Section 1018 Requirements Registration Academic Calendars Request a Transcript Pre-Registration Procedures Graduation Degree Conferral Honors at Graduation Merchandise Financial Aid Procedures Graduation Applications Senior Deadlines & Info Study Abroad Benefits Resources Scholarships SAO Announcements Summer Learning Academic Summer Sessions Summer Learning Academies Summer Program Idea Proposal Work Experience Credit Academic Calendars Commencement Blount Library Averett Bookstore Admissions Online Financial Aid Cost of Attendance Cost and Affordability Entrance and Exit Counseling Cost of Attendance Entrance/Exit Counseling Glossary of Terms Student FA Checklist Transfer and International Students Apply For Financial Aid Alternate Resources Federal & Campus Work Study Loans and Loan Info Outside Scholarships Scholarships and Grants Scholarships & Grants – Online Year-Round Pell Grants Military Aid Military Scholarships Consumer Right to Know: Policies and Information Verification Student Financial Forms Averett Online Financial Aid Forms Financial Aid Calculators NetPrice Calculator Net Price Calculator (Averett Online) ABSN Early Aid Estimator Student Health Insurance Student Accounts – Traditional Student Accounts – Averett Online GradReady Level Up Virginia Contact Us Student Life About Student Life Arrival and Departure Policy Averett Bookstore Campus Mailroom Public Safety Disaster Preparedness Emergency Procedures Winter Weather Preparedness Tornado Evacuation Locations Fire Procedure Counseling Services Counseling – Schedule an Appointment Counseling FAQ What to Expect from Counseling Services Mental Health Emergencies Telehealth Information Dean of Students’ Office Families & Parents International Student Services Transportation Dining Hall / Jut’s Café Faculty & Staff Meals Residence Life Forms Health Services Fever/COVID/Flu Information Required Health Forms Student Health Insurance Housing and Residence Life Maintenance Request Housing and Residence Life Forms Returning Student Housing Incoming Student Housing Residence Halls Bishop Residence Hall Fugate Residence Hall Main Residence Hall Danville Residence Hall Averett Commons Apartments RA Selection Timeline Residency Requirement Spiritual Life Student Engagement Clubs and Organizations Commuter Students Intramural Sports Orientation SGA Student Handbook Athletics Alumni Homecoming Upcoming Alumni Events Alumni Board Alumni Board Application Alumni Association Alumni Awards Alumni Awards Nomination Distinguished Alumni Award Recipients Mary Jo Davis Outstanding Alumni Award Recipients Recent Distinguished Alumni Award Recipients Frank Campbell Service Award Recipients Fugate-Davis Women’s Leadership Award Recipients Alumni News Contact Info Update Refer a Friend Request a Transcript Give to Averett Merchandise Giving Ways to Give Donate to the Averett Fund Donate to Cougar Cares Join the Circle of Champions Barbara Kushubar ’75 Memorial Fund Charles S. Harris Memorial Fund Giving Tips Planned Giving Contact Us Donate Now MENU Please Select Page --- Office of the President Averett Blog Averett at a Glance Mission, Vision, & Core Values Averett Value Propositions Human Resources & Payroll Title IX Our Campuses Media News & Events Find AU People Arts@Averett Home ‣ About Us ‣ Mission & Core Values ‣ Averett Value Propositions Averett University: Value Propositions These are points that demonstrate the brand’s value in comparison with competitors. The value that Averett University brings can be summed up into one word: Access . Being a member of the Averett Family means you are granted an all-access pass, and we hold nothing back when it comes to supporting those who study here, those who work here, those who grow here. Access at Averett means access to relationships – meaningful, purposeful connections with everyone around you. Like the bonds you’ll form with other members of the incredibly diverse student body, or connections you’ll make in the alumni network of more than 25,000 that spans the globe. Or like the rapport you’ll build with esteemed faculty poised to guide and elevate you as you step out into your career field, or t he dedicated staff you’ll interact with who will support you every step of the way until you’ve crossed the stage at Commencement. Or even the unique access you’ll have to University administration, such as dinner in the President’s home in your freshman year, or phone calls and video chats with administrators, just to see how you’re doing in school and beyond. Averett is just the right size, allowing for these relationships to develop at every level of the institution. Access at Averett means access to your future now , realizing your potential from the beginning. You don’t have to wait semester after semester to access your major – your time is now! Aeronautics majors fly in their first semester. Equestrian studies majors ride in their first week. Theatre majors star in major productions. Biology majors work alongside faculty on cutting-edge research. Student-athletes have the opportunity to compete at the varsity level. Adult students utilize what they learn in class the very next day at work. Access at Averett means access to the community , to the region , and to the world . Community engagement is embedded into the Averett curriculum from the very first semester. With a major regional commitment to community engagement, experiential learning and career development, Averett is a thought leader in an engaged campus community and a trailblazer in service-learning, allowing students to gain real-world know-how interwoven into their academic experience throughout their college career and beyond. Many of our adult students and alumni are already leaders in their communities, generously serving populations and organizations. All of this collective access ultimately results in student success and impactful experiences that will follow our graduates throughout their lifetimes. Averett University: Brand Pillars These are the claims and reasons to believe in a brand. Transformative Engaging Cultivating Accessible Volunteerism Empowering Diverse Experiential Learning Supportive Personal Leadership Development Enriching High-Touch Partnerships Interdisciplinary Averett University: Brand Positioning The distinctive position that a brand adopts in its competitive environment to ensure it is differentiated and preferred. For prospective students who want to transform their future now while engaging with the community around them, Averett is the right-sized University where they can cultivate meaningful and impactful relationships with access to support from across every level of the institution, truly becoming part of the Averett Family. MAIN CAMPUS 420 West Main St., Danville, VA 24541 Phone: (434) 791-5600 1-800-AVERETT NORTH CAMPUS 707 Mount Cross Road, Danville, VA 24540 Phone: (434) 791-5700 1-800-AVERETT © 2026 Averett University. All rights reserved. Careers | Sitemap | Privacy & Cookies Policy We use cookies on our website to give you the most relevant experience by remembering your preferences and repeat visits. By clicking “Accept”, you consent to the use of ALL the cookies. Do not sell my personal information . Settings Accept Privacy & Cookies Policy Close Privacy Overview This website uses cookies to improve your experience while you navigate through the website. Out of these cookies, the cookies that are categorized as necessary are stored on your browser as they are as essential for the working of basic functionalities of the website. We also use third-party cookies that help us analyze and understand how you use this website. These cookies will be stored in your browser only with your consent. You also have the option to opt-out of these cookies. But opting out of some of these cookies may have an effect on your browsing experience. Necessary Necessary Always Enabled Necessary cookies are absolutely essential for the website to function properly. This category only includes cookies that ensures basic functionalities and security features of the website. These cookies do not store any personal information. SAVE & ACCEPT"
    },
