inancial Aid Alternate Resources Federal & Campus Work Study Loans and Loan Info Outside Scholarships Scholarships and Grants Scholarships & Grants – Online Year-Round Pell Grants Military Aid Military Scholarships Consumer Right to Know: Policies and Information Verification Student Financial Forms Averett Online Financial Aid Forms Financial Aid Calculators NetPrice Calculator Net Price Calculator (Averett Online) ABSN Early Aid Estimator Student Health Insurance Student Accounts – Traditional Student Accounts – Averett Online GradReady Level Up Virginia Contact Us Student Life About Student Life Arrival and Departure Policy Averett Bookstore Campus Mailroom Public Safety Disaster Preparedness Emergency Procedures Winter Weather Preparedness Tornado Evacuation Locations Fire Procedure Counseling Services Counseling – Schedule an Appointment Counseling FAQ What to Expect from Counseling Services Mental Health Emergencies Telehealth Information Dean of Students’ Office Families & Parents International Student Services Transportation Dining Hall / Jut’s Café Faculty & Staff Meals Residence Life Forms Health Services Fever/COVID/Flu Information Required Health Forms Student Health Insurance Housing and Residence Life Maintenance Request Housing and Residence Life Forms Returning Student Housing Incoming Student Housing Residence Halls Bishop Residence Hall Fugate Residence Hall Main Residence Hall Danville Residence Hall Averett Commons Apartments RA Selection Timeline Residency Requirement Spiritual Life Student Engagement Clubs and Organizations Commuter Students Intramural Sports Orientation SGA Student Handbook Athletics Alumni Homecoming Upcoming Alumni Events Alumni Board Alumni Board Application Alumni Association Alumni Awards Alumni Awards Nomination Distinguished Alumni Award Recipients Mary Jo Davis Outstanding Alumni Award Recipients Recent Distinguished Alumni Award Recipients Frank Campbell Service Award Recipients Fugate-Davis Women’s Leadership Award Recipients Alumni News Contact Info Update Refer a Friend Request a Transcript Give to Averett Merchandise Giving Ways to Give Donate to the Averett Fund Donate to Cougar Cares Join the Circle of Champions Barbara Kushubar ’75 Memorial Fund Charles S. Harris Memorial Fund Giving Tips Planned Giving Contact Us Donate Now MENU Please Select Page --- About Student Life Arrival and Departure Policy Averett Bookstore Campus Mailroom Public Safety Counseling Services Dean of Students' Office Families & Parents International Student Services Transportation Dining Hall / Jut’s Café Residence Life Forms Health Services Housing and Residence Life Spiritual Life Student Engagement Student Handbook Home ‣ Student Life ‣ Dean of Student’s Office Student Life at Averett University Dear Averett Cougars: The student life staff at Averett University is happy that you are that you have chosen Averett as your new home! College can be a fulfilling and rewarding experience and is a time to learn all sorts of new things. Learning occurs in the classroom as you prepare yourself to become an accomplished professional in your field of study. Personal learning and growth also occurs as a direct result of your active engagement in the University community. The entire staff of the student life department at Averett is committed to enhancing student life to get the most out of the collegiate experience. Our responsibility to you is to provide support and resources to facilitate responsible life choices and encourage a vibrant Averett University community. As you begin or continue on your journey at Averett, we encourage you to actively engage with your classmates and faculty. Consider joining a student organization or seek out a student employment position to further enhance your collegiate journey. Averett is a diverse community made up of a wide variety of students, we encourage you to take advantage of every opportunity to get to know someone different than yourself. We want to be your point of contact during your time at Averett University when you need assistance. If you are unable to find what you are looking for on our websites, please do not hesitate to visit us on the fourth floor of the student center. We encourage you to leave Averett and the city of Danville better than you found it – be a catalyst for positive change! Go Cougars! MAIN CAMPUS 420 West Main St., Danville, VA 24541 Phone: (434) 791-5600 1-800-AVERETT NORTH CAMPUS 707 Mount Cross Road, Danville, VA 24540 Phone: (434) 791-5700 1-800-AVERETT © 2026 Averett University. All rights reserved. Careers | Sitemap | Privacy & Cookies Policy We use cookies on our website to give you the most relevant experience by remembering your preferences and repeat visits. By clicking “Accept”, you consent to the use of ALL the cookies. Do not sell my personal information . Settings Accept Privacy & Cookies Policy Close Privacy Overview This website uses cookies to improve your experience while you navigate through the website. Out of these cookies, the cookies that are categorized as necessary are stored on your browser as they are as essential for the working of basic functionalities of the website. We also use third-party cookies that help us analyze and understand how you use this website. These cookies will be stored in your browser only with your consent. You also have the option to opt-out of these cookies. But opting out of some of these cookies may have an effect on your browsing experience. Necessary Necessary Always Enabled Necessary cookies are absolutely essential for the website to function properly. This category only includes cookies that ensures basic functionalities and security features of the website. These cookies do not store any personal information. SAVE & ACCEPT"
